{"type":"convention","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-05-15T14:46:20.557Z","evidence":{"commit":"81fd8b8a3c0c4c517d7ec3c9d32e5da9280e3a0d"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-brand-profile"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"Migrations are NOT created automatically when Prisma schema is edited. Builder MUST run `pnpm db:migrate -- --name <slug>` to create the migration directory before `pnpm probe:smoke`; otherwise the API returns 500 (table does not exist) and every special-flow assertion fails.","id":"mx-325de6"}
{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-15T14:46:20.787Z","evidence":{"commit":"81fd8b8a3c0c4c517d7ec3c9d32e5da9280e3a0d"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-brand-profile"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"ZodValidationPipe applied via `@UsePipes()` on a handler with both `@Param` and `@Body` runs against EVERY parameter — the id path-param value (a string) gets safeParsed against the body schema and fails 400. Always bind: `@Body(new ZodValidationPipe(schema)) body`.","id":"mx-4d4764"}
